ChorusDraft Linux Elixir experiment (unreleased)
Modification notice — September 5, 2026

This testing build is a modified work based on ChorusDraft 0.51 and the security
fixes prepared as 0.51.1. ChorusDraft is itself based on the feature sets of
Bluesky Bot 1.0.3 and Mastodon Bot 1.0.2, authored by Buntatoes and distributed
under the GNU General Public License version 3.

The experimental branch implements the shared Linux runtime in Elixir
and presents the two products as BlueBot and Mastobot. It retains interactive
review for AI drafts, privacy exclusions, do-not-contact controls, interaction
limits, credential-safe errors, and ambiguous-publication handling. It also adds
optional Bluesky Jetstream, read-only state import, and Linux packages containing
corresponding application/dependency source and notices. It has not
been published as a release and should be treated as test software.

